        "type": "content",
        "html": "<h3 class=\"text-base font-extrabold text-white mt-5 mb-3\">Alphabet Code Map (EJOTY)</h3><p class=\"my-2 text-gray-300\">Memorize position blocks: E(5), J(10), O(15), T(20), Y(25). Opposite alphabet pairs sum is always <strong class=\"text-white font-extrabold\">27</strong> (A+Z = 27, B+Y = 27). Mnemonic reverse pairs: A-Z (Azhar), B-Y (Boy), C-X (Crux), D-W (Dew), E-V (Love/Even), G-T (G.T. Road), H-S (High School), I-R (Indian Railways), K-P (K.P. Thakur), L-O (Love), M-N (Man).</p><div class=\"overflow-x-auto my-3\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-[11px] border-collapse\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-white/10 text-gray-400 font-bold text-[9px] uppercase\"><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">A</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">B</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">C</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">D</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">E</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">F</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">G</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">H</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">I</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">J</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">K</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">L</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">M</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"text-gray-300 font-mono\"><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">1</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">2</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">3</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">4</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">5</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">6</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">7</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">8</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">9</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">10</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">11</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">12</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">13</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">26</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">25</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">24</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">23</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">22</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">21</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">20</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">19</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">18</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">17</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">16</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">15</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">14</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Z</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Y</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">X</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">W</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">V</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">U</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">T</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">S</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">R</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Q</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">P</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">O</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">N</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"overflow-x-auto my-3\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-[11px] border-collapse\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-white/10 text-gray-400 font-bold text-[9px] uppercase\"><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">N</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">O</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">P</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">Q</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">R</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">S</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">T</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">U</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">V</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">W</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">X</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">Y</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">Z</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"text-gray-300 font-mono\"><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">14</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">15</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">16</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">17</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">18</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">19</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">20</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">21</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">22</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">23</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">24</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">25</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">26</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">13</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">12</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">11</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">10</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">9</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">8</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">7</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">6</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">5</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">4</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">3</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">2</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">1</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">M</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">L</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">K</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">J</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">I</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">H</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">G</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">F</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">E</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">D</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">C</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">B</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">A</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
