    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "",
        "type": "content",
        "html": "<h3 class=\"text-base font-extrabold text-white mt-5 mb-3\">🔥 Top 15 Articles to Memorize First</h3><p class=\"my-2 text-gray-300\">These 15 articles carry 80% of the weightage for direct factual questions in SSC exams. Memorize these cold before studying the rest!</p><div class=\"overflow-x-auto my-3\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-[11px] border-collapse\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-white/10 text-gray-400 font-bold text-[9px] uppercase\"><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">Article</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">Topic</th><th class=\"pb-1.5 text-accentCyan\">Core Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"text-gray-300 font-mono\"><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\"><strong class=\"text-white font-extrabold\">Article 1</strong></td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">India, Union of States</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Defines territory of India</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\"><strong class=\"text-white font-extrabold\">Article 14</strong></td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Equality</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Equality before law &amp; equal protection</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\"><strong class=\"text-white font-extrabold\">Article 19</strong></td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Freedom</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Six fundamental democratic freedoms</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\"><strong class=\"text-white font-extrabold\">Article 21</strong></td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Right to Life</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Protection of life and personal liberty</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\"><strong class=\"text-white font-extrabold\">Article 21A</strong></td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Education</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Free &amp; compulsory education for 6-14 yrs</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\"><strong class=\"text-white font-extrabold\">Article 32</strong></td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Constitutional Remedies</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Right to move SC for FR enforcement</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\"><strong class=\"text-white font-extrabold\">Article 39A</strong></td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Free Legal Aid</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Free legal services for poor citizens</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\"><strong class=\"text-white font-extrabold\">Article 44</strong></td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Uniform Civil Code (UCC)</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Uniform laws for all religious communities</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\"><strong class=\"text-white font-extrabold\">Article 51A</strong></td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Fundamental Duties</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">11 core citizen responsibilities</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\"><strong class=\"text-white font-extrabold\">Article 52</strong></td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">President</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Defines the head of executive</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\"><strong class=\"text-white font-extrabold\">Article 74</strong></td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Council of Ministers</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">PM &amp; Cabinet to advise the President</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\"><strong class=\"text-white font-extrabold\">Article 80</strong></td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Rajya Sabha</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Composition of the Upper House</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\"><strong class=\"text-white font-extrabold\">Article 110</strong></td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Money Bill</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Definition &amp; procedures for Money Bills</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\"><strong class=\"text-white font-extrabold\">Article 324</strong></td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Election Commission</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Supervise, direct, &amp; control elections</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\"><strong class=\"text-white font-extrabold\">Article 368</strong></td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Constitutional Amendment</td><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-2\">Power &amp; procedure of Parliament to amend</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
      }
    ]
